{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">屯門發生一宗罕見的車輛遭狗隻破壞事件。今日（18日）凌晨 3 時31分，警方接獲一名女子報案，指發現其住所附近一輛停泊於屯門富盛街18號對開的私家車，正遭到4隻狗隻破壞。警員接報趕抵現場，發現涉事私家車車身留有刮痕且車頭泵把損毀，案件隨後列作「流浪動物」處理，並已聯絡車主作進一步跟進。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-23-10h29m06s414.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026QJ4W12nO1q1790130854.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-23-10h29m06s414.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">網絡近日流傳一段相關影片，直擊事發經過。影片顯示，涉事私家車停泊期間突遭4隻狗隻圍繞徘徊，期間其中一隻狗突然咬住私家車車頭泵把並不斷用力向後拉扯，現場傳出幾聲嘈吵響聲，場面相當嚇人。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-23-10h29m18s470.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/202681CR7IQDcs1790130862.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-23-10h29m18s470.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">拍片者事後將影片上載至社交平台，並留言呼籲：「有幾隻狗咬緊你部車，識個車主就快啲通知佢。」拍片者其後補充，報警後約10分鐘警員便趕到現場，4隻狗隻見狀即時四散逃逸。拍片者目擊指，該私家車車頭「成隻角扯左出黎」，連車尾泵把亦懷疑遭到破壞。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T02:59:10.092329+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":354,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}